---
const title = 'Contact USIVA | Start with a Clear Question';
const description = 'Prepare a concise visa-readiness question, choose the right pathway, and understand what USIVA can and cannot collect through this public page.';
const canonical = 'https://usiva.org/contacts.html';
---
<!doctype html>
<html lang="en">
  <head>
    <meta charset="utf-8" />
    <meta name="viewport" content="width=device-width, initial-scale=1" />
    <title>{title}</title>
    <meta name="description" content={description} />
    <link rel="canonical" href={canonical} />
    <meta name="robots" content="index,follow" />
    <meta property="og:type" content="website" />
    <meta property="og:title" content={title} />
    <meta property="og:description" content={description} />
    <meta property="og:url" content={canonical} />
    <meta property="og:image" content="https://usiva.org/assets/usiva-social.svg" />
    <meta property="og:image:alt" content="USIVA — visa-readiness and compliance planning" />
    <meta name="theme-color" content="#0b5f5a" />
  </head>
  <body class="contacts-page">
    <a class="skip-link" href="#main">Skip to content</a>
    <div class="contact-bar"><div class="contact-wrap"><span>A clear question is the safest first handoff.</span><a href="/tips-faq.html">Read the FAQ →</a></div></div>
    <header class="site-header"><div class="contact-wrap header-inner"><a class="brand" href="/" aria-label="USIVA home"><span class="brand-mark" aria-hidden="true">US</span><span><strong>USIVA</strong><small>U.S. Immigration &amp; Visa Association</small></span></a><nav aria-label="Primary navigation"><a href="/services.html">Services</a><a href="/about.html">About</a><a href="/pricing.html">Scope &amp; fees</a><a href="/blog.html">Field notes</a><a class="nav-cta" href="/contacts.html" aria-current="page">Start a question</a></nav></div></header>

    <main id="main">
      <section class="contact-hero"><div class="contact-wrap contact-hero__grid"><div><p class="eyebrow">Contacts / start here</p><h1>A good first message is a decision, not a biography.</h1><p class="hero-lede">Use this page to prepare a careful handoff. It does not collect a submission, promise a response time, or create an immigration case.</p><div class="actions"><a class="button button--gold" href="#routes">Choose the right route</a><a class="button button--outline" href="/services.html">Review planning lanes</a></div></div><aside class="contact-card"><p class="card-label">Privacy boundary</p><strong>Do not send passport numbers or sensitive identity documents through an unconfigured page.</strong><p>Keep the first question short. Share personal records only through a verified, appropriate channel requested by the responsible provider or authority.</p></aside></div></section>

      <section class="section" id="routes" aria-labelledby="route-heading"><div class="contact-wrap"><div class="section-head"><p class="eyebrow">Choose the destination</p><h2 id="route-heading">The right next action depends on what you are trying to do.</h2><p>USIVA can help you organize the question. The links below point to the public pathway or planning page that matches the decision.</p></div><div class="route-list">
        <a class="route route--green" href="https://usfellows.org/international-rd-scholars.html"><span class="route-number">01</span><span><strong>Explore the International R&amp;D Scholars pathway</strong><small>Use the US Fellows page for the research-pathway conversation and program context.</small></span><b aria-hidden="true">↗</b></a>
        <a class="route route--paper" href="/services.html"><span class="route-number">02</span><span><strong>Organize a visa-readiness question</strong><small>Use the service map for records, timing, authorization boundaries, and source checks.</small></span><b aria-hidden="true">→</b></a>
        <a class="route route--blue" href="https://usfellows.org/submit-opportunity.html"><span class="route-number">03</span><span><strong>Discuss a program or partner opportunity</strong><small>Use the public US Fellows route for an opportunity submission or partner conversation.</small></span><b aria-hidden="true">↗</b></a>
        <a class="route route--red" href="/tips-faq.html#escalate"><span class="route-number">04</span><span><strong>Find the boundary before sharing facts</strong><small>Read when general content is not enough and a licensed immigration attorney may be the right next step.</small></span><b aria-hidden="true">→</b></a>
      </div></div></section>

      <section class="section section--paper" aria-labelledby="brief-heading"><div class="contact-wrap brief-grid"><div class="brief-intro"><p class="eyebrow">The question brief</p><h2 id="brief-heading">Four lines are enough to make a handoff useful.</h2><p>Write these down before you open a message, meeting, or application portal. Leave out identifying numbers until the recipient gives you a verified way to share them.</p></div><dl class="brief-list"><div><dt>Current stage</dt><dd>Exploring, preparing, admitted, studying, researching, or planning a next step.</dd></div><div><dt>Purpose</dt><dd>Study, research, training, travel, assistantship, internship, or employment question.</dd></div><div><dt>Decision date</dt><dd>The deadline, start date, interview, travel date, or authorization window that matters.</dd></div><div><dt>Unclear item</dt><dd>The instruction, document, activity, or promise you need the responsible authority to verify.</dd></div></dl></div></section>

      <section class="no-form" aria-labelledby="no-form-heading"><div class="contact-wrap no-form__grid"><div><p class="eyebrow eyebrow--light">A deliberate limit</p><h2 id="no-form-heading">There is no public submission form on this page.</h2></div><div><p>This route does not connect to an intake endpoint, CRM, or case-management workflow. That is why it does not ask for your name, passport, address, or documents.</p><p>If a person or provider asks for sensitive information, verify the destination independently and confirm why it is needed before sharing it. For individualized immigration advice, consult a licensed attorney in the relevant jurisdiction.</p><a class="text-link" href="/pricing.html">Review scope questions before paying →</a></div></div></section>

      <section class="contact-next" aria-labelledby="next-heading"><div class="contact-wrap contact-next__inner"><div><p class="eyebrow">Make the next move</p><h2 id="next-heading">Take the smallest action that gets you closer to a verified answer.</h2></div><div class="actions"><a class="button button--red" href="https://usfellows.org/apply.html">Open the US Fellows application path ↗</a><a class="button button--quiet" href="/other-pages.html">Return to the route atlas</a></div></div></section>

      <section class="notice"><div class="contact-wrap"><strong>Important notice:</strong> USIVA content is informational planning content. It does not create an attorney-client relationship or guarantee admission, employment, funding, visa issuance, or government approval.</div></section>
    </main>

    <footer class="site-footer"><div class="contact-wrap footer-grid"><div><a class="footer-brand" href="/">USIVA</a><p>Visa-readiness and compliance planning for international study and research pathways.</p></div><div><p class="footer-label">Explore</p><a href="/services.html">Services</a><a href="/about.html">About USIVA</a><a href="/pricing.html">Scope &amp; fees</a></div><div><p class="footer-label">Questions</p><a href="/tips-faq.html">Tips &amp; FAQ</a><a href="/blog.html">Field notes</a><a href="/media-gallery.html">Media &amp; field notes</a></div><div><p class="footer-label">External path</p><a href="https://usfellows.org/international-rd-scholars.html">US Fellows International R&amp;D Scholars ↗</a><p>Do not send sensitive identity documents through an unverified channel.</p></div></div><div class="contact-wrap footer-bottom">© 2026 USIVA · A US Council companion site.</div></footer>
  </body>
</html>

<style>
  :global(*) { box-sizing: border-box; }
  :global(html) { scroll-behavior: smooth; }
  :global(body) { margin: 0; background: #fbfaf7; color: #172231; font-family: Inter, ui-sans-serif, system-ui, -apple-system, BlinkMacSystemFont, "Segoe UI", sans-serif; line-height: 1.65; -webkit-font-smoothing: antialiased; }
  :global(a) { color: inherit; text-decoration: none; }
  :global(a:focus-visible) { outline: 3px solid #d0a85c; outline-offset: 4px; }
  :global(p) { margin: 0 0 1rem; color: #5c6974; }
  :global(h1), :global(h2), :global(h3) { margin: 0 0 .7rem; color: #0a253f; font-family: Georgia, "Times New Roman", serif; font-weight: 600; line-height: 1.08; }
  :global(h1) { font-size: clamp(3rem, 7.2vw, 7rem); letter-spacing: -.055em; }
  :global(h2) { font-size: clamp(2.1rem, 4.2vw, 4.3rem); letter-spacing: -.04em; }
  .contact-wrap { width: min(1160px, calc(100% - 48px)); margin-inline: auto; }
  .skip-link { position: fixed; top: -4rem; left: 1rem; z-index: 20; padding: .7rem 1rem; background: #fff; color: #0a253f; font-weight: 800; }
  .skip-link:focus { top: 1rem; }
  .contact-bar { background: #071827; color: #dce7eb; font-size: .78rem; letter-spacing: .04em; }
  .contact-bar .contact-wrap { display: flex; justify-content: space-between; gap: 1rem; padding-block: .55rem; }
  .contact-bar a { color: #f0d798; font-weight: 850; }
  .site-header { background: #fbfaf7; border-bottom: 1px solid #d8dfe1; }
  .header-inner { display: flex; align-items: center; justify-content: space-between; gap: 2rem; min-height: 5.6rem; }
  .brand { display: inline-flex; align-items: center; gap: .75rem; }
  .brand-mark { display: grid; width: 2.8rem; height: 2.8rem; place-items: center; border: 1px solid #b9893e; border-radius: 50%; color: #0a253f; font: 700 .8rem Georgia, serif; box-shadow: inset 0 0 0 4px #fbfaf7, inset 0 0 0 5px #b9893e; }
  .brand strong { display: block; color: #0a253f; font: 700 1.5rem/1 Georgia, serif; letter-spacing: .04em; }
  .brand small { display: block; color: #52616a; font-size: .58rem; letter-spacing: .1em; text-transform: uppercase; }
  nav { display: flex; flex-wrap: wrap; justify-content: flex-end; gap: .3rem 1.25rem; color: #334350; font-size: .84rem; font-weight: 750; }
  nav a:hover, nav a[aria-current="page"] { color: #ae403a; }
  .nav-cta { padding: .55rem .8rem; border: 1px solid #ae403a; color: #ae403a; }
  .contact-hero { background: #e2eeea; border-bottom: 1px solid #c8dad5; }
  .contact-hero__grid { display: grid; grid-template-columns: minmax(0, 1.2fr) minmax(18rem, .8fr); gap: clamp(2rem, 7vw, 8rem); align-items: end; min-height: 39rem; padding-block: clamp(4.5rem, 10vw, 8rem) clamp(3.5rem, 7vw, 6rem); }
  .contact-hero__grid > div { max-width: 57rem; }
  .eyebrow, .card-label, .footer-label { display: block; margin-bottom: 1rem; color: #ae403a; font-size: .72rem; font-weight: 900; letter-spacing: .16em; text-transform: uppercase; }
  .hero-lede { max-width: 46rem; margin-top: 1.5rem; color: #40515b; font-size: clamp(1.15rem, 2vw, 1.5rem); line-height: 1.5; }
  .actions { display: flex; flex-wrap: wrap; gap: .75rem; margin-top: 2rem; }
  .button { display: inline-flex; align-items: center; justify-content: center; min-height: 3rem; padding: .75rem 1.05rem; border: 1px solid #ae403a; font-size: .75rem; font-weight: 900; letter-spacing: .09em; text-transform: uppercase; }
  .button--gold { border-color: #c49a4f; background: #c49a4f; color: #071827; }
  .button--outline { border-color: #516b72; color: #263844; }
  .button--red { background: #ae403a; color: #fff; }
  .button:hover { transform: translateY(-1px); }
  .contact-card { padding: 1.8rem; border-top: 5px solid #ae403a; background: #fffdf9; box-shadow: 1rem 1rem 0 rgba(10,37,63,.1); }
  .contact-card strong { display: block; margin-bottom: 1rem; color: #0a253f; font: 600 clamp(1.55rem, 2.7vw, 2.4rem)/1.08 Georgia, serif; }
  .contact-card p:last-child { margin: 0; font-size: .9rem; }
  .section { padding-block: clamp(4.5rem, 9vw, 8rem); }
  .section--paper { background: #f2ede4; border-block: 1px solid #e0d9cd; }
  .section-head { max-width: 54rem; margin-bottom: 3rem; }
  .section-head > p:last-child { max-width: 44rem; font-size: 1.06rem; }
  .route-list { border-top: 1px solid #c3ced0; }
  .route { display: grid; grid-template-columns: 3rem 1fr 2rem; gap: 1.2rem; align-items: start; padding: 1.55rem 1.2rem; border-bottom: 1px solid #c3ced0; }
  .route:hover { transform: translateX(.25rem); }
  .route-number { color: #ae403a; font: 700 .78rem ui-monospace, SFMono-Regular, Menlo, monospace; }
  .route strong { display: block; margin-bottom: .25rem; color: #0a253f; font: 600 1.55rem Georgia, serif; }
  .route small { display: block; color: #4d5d66; font-size: .92rem; }
  .route > b { color: #ae403a; font-size: 1.2rem; }
  .route--green { background: #dfece7; }
  .route--paper { background: #f8f5ef; }
  .route--blue { background: #e3edf3; }
  .route--red { background: #f2dfdb; }
  .brief-grid { display: grid; grid-template-columns: minmax(0, .8fr) minmax(0, 1.2fr); gap: clamp(2rem, 8vw, 9rem); align-items: start; }
  .brief-intro { max-width: 29rem; }
  .brief-intro p:last-child { font-size: 1.05rem; }
  .brief-list { margin: 0; padding: 0; border-top: 1px solid #c6cfcf; }
  .brief-list > div { display: grid; grid-template-columns: minmax(8rem, .45fr) 1fr; gap: 1.5rem; padding: 1.25rem 0; border-bottom: 1px solid #c6cfcf; }
  dt { color: #0a253f; font-weight: 850; }
  dd { margin: 0; color: #5c6974; font-size: .95rem; }
  .no-form { padding-block: clamp(4.5rem, 8vw, 7rem); background: #071827; }
  .no-form__grid { display: grid; grid-template-columns: minmax(0, .85fr) minmax(0, 1.15fr); gap: clamp(2rem, 7vw, 8rem); }
  .no-form h2 { color: #fff; }
  .no-form p { color: #d3e0e5; }
  .eyebrow--light { color: #efd69b; }
  .text-link { display: inline-block; margin-top: .5rem; color: #f0d798; font-size: .87rem; font-weight: 850; }
  .contact-next { padding-block: clamp(4.5rem, 8vw, 7rem); }
  .contact-next__inner { display: grid; grid-template-columns: minmax(0, 1fr) auto; gap: 2rem; align-items: end; }
  .contact-next__inner > div:first-child { max-width: 45rem; }
  .contact-next .actions { margin-top: 0; }
  .notice { padding-block: 1.2rem; background: #f8e7be; color: #36280e; font-size: .88rem; }
  .site-footer { padding-block: 4rem 1.5rem; background: #0b2238; color: #cad7df; }
  .footer-grid { display: grid; grid-template-columns: 1.2fr .7fr .8fr 1.1fr; gap: 2rem; }
  .footer-brand { display: inline-block; margin-bottom: .8rem; color: #fff; font: 700 1.55rem Georgia, serif; letter-spacing: .04em; }
  .site-footer p { color: #b5c5cf; font-size: .86rem; }
  .site-footer a { display: block; margin: .35rem 0; color: #d9e4e9; font-size: .86rem; }
  .site-footer a:hover { color: #f0d798; }
  .footer-label { margin-bottom: .7rem; color: #efd69b; }
  .footer-bottom { margin-top: 3rem; padding-top: 1rem; border-top: 1px solid rgba(255,255,255,.16); color: #8ea3b0; font-size: .78rem; }
  @media (max-width: 900px) {
    .header-inner { align-items: flex-start; flex-direction: column; padding-block: 1rem; }
    nav { justify-content: flex-start; }
    .contact-hero__grid, .brief-grid, .no-form__grid, .contact-next__inner { grid-template-columns: 1fr; }
    .contact-hero__grid { min-height: auto; }
    .contact-card { max-width: 34rem; }
    .contact-next .actions { margin-top: 1rem; }
    .footer-grid { grid-template-columns: 1fr 1fr; }
  }
  @media (max-width: 640px) {
    .contact-wrap { width: min(100% - 2rem, 1160px); }
    .contact-bar .contact-wrap { display: block; }
    .contact-bar a { display: inline-block; margin-top: .3rem; }
    .brief-list > div { grid-template-columns: 1fr; gap: .3rem; }
    .route { grid-template-columns: 2rem 1fr 1.3rem; gap: .7rem; padding-inline: .6rem; }
    .route strong { font-size: 1.25rem; }
    .footer-grid { grid-template-columns: 1fr; }
    .actions .button { width: 100%; }
  }
  @media (prefers-reduced-motion: reduce) { :global(html) { scroll-behavior: auto; } .button:hover, .route:hover { transform: none; } }
</style>
